Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Polly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I'll get you the money!
