Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:01:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.54,0:02:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The debt collectors are after him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, I can't give\Nyou money if I don't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making excuses and pay up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna chase me all the\Nway to my grave, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaggaras, and just in time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rope, action!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's one of the shipwrights\Nfrom Galley-La, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, fellas, but I gotta\Nborrow those yaggaras now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for my round turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awwww!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.52,0:02:52.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(550,0)\t(505,550,\1a&H00&)}The Case of the Kidnapped Pirate
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.52,0:02:52.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(550,0)}The Case of the Kidnapped Pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You punk! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a wonderful race, as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, and maybe you\Ncan try again next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, for Jagera, you sure\Nhave a good sense of dramatic timing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.54,0:03:11.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(203,292)\fs48\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(440,0)\t(395,440,\1a&H00&)}Paulie{\fs37}\NRigging and Mast Foreman\NDock {1}One\NGalley-La Company
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.54,0:03:11.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(203,292)\fs48\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(440,0)}Paulie{\fs37}\NRigging and Mast Foreman\NDock {1}One\NGalley-La Company
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those shipwrights of yours have\Ngot some pretty fancy moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, thanks for the help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think we'd\Nnever see our money again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it must mean this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk's stealing our stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get your money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, a pigeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me go, let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.47,0:03:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stop pitching my ear now. Ah!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.63,0:04:04.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(853,416)\fs48\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(360,0)\t(315,360,\1a&H00&)}Rob Lucci{\fs37}\NGalley-La Company\NDock 1\NSawyer and Treenail Foreman
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.63,0:04:04.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(853,416)\fs48\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(360,0)}Rob Lucci{\fs37}\NGalley-La Company\NDock 1\NSawyer and Treenail Foreman
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was lucky enough to find\Nthat money and you screw it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better watch your back, Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pay back your debt with\Nsomeone else's money, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I happened upon that\Nmoney fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stealing from thieves is still stealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't steal anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just borrowing\Nthe Yagata, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad things worked out for you, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worked out for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That 200 million was for\Nship repairs, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all you did was sit there and stare\Nlike a fool while I nearly got carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but the physician\Nsaid he'd handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, we will deal with\Nour employee appropriately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to handle this so\Nthere's no bad blood between you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although Polly's behavior\Nwas reprehensible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's fortunate that he saved your\Nmoney from the Franky family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you could\Nlook at it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No harm done, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, who is this Franky family?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they rob from everyone\Nthey run into or just us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it depends, but\Nnormally they dismantle ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean they're workmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I'd never\Nhire a team that looks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not just ship dismantlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're also bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time they find out there are pirates\Nin town, they cause quite a ruckus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, they're\Njust a public nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only do they collect bounties\Non the pirates they defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they also take possession of their ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, they dismantle them and sell\Nwhatever parts they can on the open market.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may seem underhanded, but\Nfor them, it's good business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of jerkwads!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they're trying to\Ndismantle the whole pirate lifestyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they catch you, they\Nwill certainly bleed you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys look too weak\Nto do anything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The men you saw were underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, the leader of the group,\Nis not nearly as harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I would\Navoid him at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go iceberg, do\Nwith him as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here, you can let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work as always, Lucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly, I can't apologize enough\Nfor the actions of this elf.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,504)\fs48\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(350,0)\t(305,350,\1a&H00&)}Hattori{\fs37}\NLucci's Pigeon
Dialogue: 2,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(647,504)\fs48\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(350,0)}Hattori{\fs37}\NLucci's Pigeon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the nice people\Nthat you're sorry, elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pigeon really has it out\Nfor that dude, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the little bird talks but\Nthe guy in the hat doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm just glad we got our money\Nback Oh, so these belong to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to thank me, give me 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, I'm quite sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This imbecile is addicted\Nto gambling, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's racked up such a\Nmassive debt that it's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made him lose sight of\Neverything but greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know why you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had about enough of you\Nrunning your mouth, Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll shut you up. Rope. Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kukalukaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blueno!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's serious, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hook, line and sinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he landed on his head,\Nbut he stopped himself with his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but he dug\Nhis hand into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, does he have fingers\Nof steel or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are just shipwrights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they need all\Nthese crazy powers for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you with the goggles on your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, man, think\Nabout this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy wasn't the one\Nsaying all that mean stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the pigeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bird could say whatever it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actions speak louder than words,\Nand Lucy's the one who hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the pigeon made him hit you because\Nhe's too much of a coward to do it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pigeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down here and fight your own fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want some more? I'll take\Nyou on any time. Enough, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please excuse us for all the fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Rob Luke I mean my name's\NHuttery and this is Rob
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucci, we both welcome you\Nto the Galley-La factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coo-coo-doo-coo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, the pigeon almost introduced\Nhimself as that guy, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the ventriloquism\Nact, isn't it? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the coolest\Ntrash-talking pigeon ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I couldn't tell it was you,\Nand I'm usually pretty sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please, it's really\Nnothing special at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a weirdo who doesn't know\Nhow to talk to people on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second, what does\Nthat woman think she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me, you harlot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see way too much leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cover up and show a\Nlittle decency, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This duck is a man's workplace, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Kalifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you those\Nclothes of yours are not appropriate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to look professional,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should wear pants or at\Nleast ankle-length skirts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's got issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's serious, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's open the gate and\Nstart the tour already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just about the\Nbiggest door I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, whoa, you have to\Nopen that thing by hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, those two can't open\Nthat on their own, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I guess they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,each doc only has five foremen,\Nand despite their peculiarities,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these two are both talented enough\Nto hold a position at Doc 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaku, who you met earlier,\Nis a foreman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a place like this, talent\Nis the only thing that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So even if they're a bit\Nstrange, we don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are pretty weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, we can go in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember to keep a\Nclose eye on your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm saying we have\Nthieves inside, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm really sorry you\Ngot dragged into that mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do a better job of protecting\Nme next time around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, no problem. I got this. I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doc One employs the strongest\Nworkers of the Galley-La Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We take on our most\Ndifficult requests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's take a look inside. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's super huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it was going to be awesome,\Nbut it's even better up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're building a big galleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who it's for!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they've got a full\Nforce working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, this way, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you guys see that?\NIceberg's here. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look sharp for the boss, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, could you take a\Nlook at the outer panels for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.30,0:11:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll stop by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovely day, you ate it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that depends on\Nhow the project's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're actually ahead of schedule, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:12:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Ice Pops is pretty\Npopular around here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a place where skill is everything,\Nit's only natural that he shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although shipbuilding has\Nalways been a thriving business,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before Iceberg's time, it was divided\Nbetween seven competing companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when he showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was something about his talent\Nthat united everyone in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With so many workers flocking to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it wasn't long before he made\Nthe seven companies into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And five years ago, Galley-La was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His passion for shipbuilding\Nhas never diminished,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and neither has the respect\Nthat the craftsmen show for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people here take pride in their\Nwork so they don't bow down to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for pirates and\Nmarine officers alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit this shipyard embodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, I hear you're\Na pretty good shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel about joining my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound like fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ntrying to pull here, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insolent little wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, he was trying\Nto pay him a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean you sailed all the way to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water 7 without any\Nshipwrights on your crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.14,0:13:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's one of the\Nreasons why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to have our ship repaired, but\Nwe're looking for a new crew member, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We certainly have plenty of\Nshipwrights to go around,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if any of them would\Nbe willing to join a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can find someone who agrees\Nto go with you, I won't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I see why people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My offer still stands, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I probably shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the mayor. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Kalifa mentioned earlier that\NNico Robin was a member of your crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's nice to have around\Nsince she's so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not something\Nwrong with her, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could watch them do this stuff all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it steady. No need\Nto rush. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get a cannon like that to\Nput on the Mary, that'd be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's so shiny and long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real Timmy Culvering cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they've really got everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it feels\Nlike to fire one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's made of copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's super expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'd let me try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got 300 million\Nberries, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can afford at least\None of those, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe two or three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that guy with the nose leave already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Kaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you are fast, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you checked the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I did, Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, that's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were wondering where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told me while they're\Nhere, how was the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if this is a joke,\NI'm sure as hell not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't lie about something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something happen to Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he was looking at the cannons\Nover there a second ago, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bags are yours, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp was supposed to be taking care\Nof those, but yeah, they're ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that idiot\Nwandering off at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how can I leave our\Nprecious money alone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those bags you found have\N200 million berries in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're funny, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how much do you think the\Nrepairs are going to cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty of money to spend,\Nand no price is too high for our Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it, why\Ndon't you make her stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,faster, as tough as nails, and, of\Ncourse, decked out with cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like some pretty engravings or\Nsome kind of decoration along the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, can you guys renovate the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ship of yours, she's gone on some\Nreally extraordinary journeys, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet, we've done it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A while back we flew in the\Nsky, then fell back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We climbed a big mountain, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you've got to work hard to\Nfix her up extra good, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her battle scars are far\Nworse than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, then you're saying it's going to\Ntake a long time for you to fix her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about skill, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying no one can\Nfix her. Not even us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means the keel's\Ndamaged, huh? That's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right it looks like it's\Ntaken a real wallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way we we've gone\Neverywhere without any problems
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until now in theory even if\Nwe did everything we could
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the probability of your ship\Nlasting till the next island?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what he said true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never sail again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.74,0:18:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Sanji I was so\Nfocused on the books that I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't notice when she left\NThere's nothing you should have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to apologize for I just\Nassumed that the person I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walking with Robin had to have\Nbeen you and your human form
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which begs the question\Nwho was that masked man
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how were they able\Nto disappear so suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Even Robin's scent disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everything's all\Nright. I feel uneasy. Do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need an examination\Nno that's not what I meant
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what Aokiji said.\NHis words keep repeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what did he say that\Nworries you it was all that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrible stuff he said\Nabout Robin's past and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then very soon we'd regret\Nher being on our crew
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah right so do you\Nthink what he said might
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have had something to do\Nwith her disappearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know we're getting\Nnowhere looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head back to the ship for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If nothing's wrong, she'll come\Nback on her own eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fix the going, Mary? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.68,0:19:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought all of you were supposed\Nto be awesome shipwrights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about the money, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you pay, that ship\Ncan't be restored to how she used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm rather impressed you\Nwere able to get that old girl this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considering the condition\Nthat she's currently in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is going on with the Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the\Nkeel is, immoral girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing at the bottom of the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the most important\Npiece of lumber on a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It crosses from stem to\Nstern and provides support.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you build a ship, you\Nstart off by placing the keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you set the wood\Nfor the stem, the stern,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the frame, frame brackets, and deck beams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the pieces are\Ncarefully assembled together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the keel serving as the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the very backbone framework\Nand life of every vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,constructed and when it's severely\Ndamaged Then that's the end of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just replace it\Nwith a new one. That'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same thing as building\Na new ship from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason we or anyone won't\Nbe able to fix her? Your ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of woods stuck\Ntogether awaiting her end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you don't say such horrible things
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horrible or not, it's the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just rebuild her from the\Nground up like you said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Build another Going Merry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, not possible. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could build you a very similar ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no one can build you one\Nthat would be exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nowhere in the world are there\Ntwo completely identical ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It simply can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are there any trees in the\Nworld that grow exactly the same way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sailing ship is mostly\Nbuilt out of lumber,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the overall size and shape of a vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is determined by the type of wood used.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why an exact\Nduplicate of your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be built by us or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even when using the same blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we made a ship like that\Nwith those specifications,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ones who would\Nnotice the difference and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel that it's a\Ncompletely different ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be all of you guys! Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it's\Nabsolutely impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us to continue\Nsailing on the Going Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can either wait\Naround for her to sink,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you can dismantle her immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.90,0:22:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real Carabelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a cool ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you guys seen the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's all done!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the Going Mary has everything\Nshe could possibly need!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, your ship is on her last legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you look at\Nthis as an opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You happen to be in the best place\Nin the world to buy a new ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand that your ship was a caravel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailing on the Grand Line in an old ship\Nlike that would be difficult to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not getting a new ship. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mary is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The going Mary is the ship\Nof the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's repaired, then\Nshe can still sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She got us here today, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you tell us out of nowhere\Nshe can't sail anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.40,0:23:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.74,0:23:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are saying that\Nbecause you don't know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.34,0:23:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how strong she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then your plan is to keep\Nsailing her until she sinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is the decision\Nof the ship's captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This discussion is over for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you decide to buy a ship, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.94,0:23:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My people can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.24,0:23:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're able to spend $300 million, we\Ncan build a state-of-the-art ship for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, if you'd look this over, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a catalog of our\Nnew and our used models.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it as a price reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's someone at the front\Ngate who wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.06,0:23:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like those world\Ngovernment officials again.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.16,0:24:01.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,295)\fs48\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(360,0)\t(315,360,\1a&H00&)}Peepley Lulu{\fs37}\NGalley-La Company\NDock 1\NPitch, Blacksmithing, and\N Block-And-Tackle Foreman
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.16,0:24:01.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,295)\fs48\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(360,0)}Peepley Lulu{\fs37}\NGalley-La Company\NDock 1\NPitch, Blacksmithing, and\N Block-And-Tackle Foreman
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.98,0:24:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I tell them you're unavailable?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.96,0:24:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, please. Say I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.66,0:24:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Lulu, you've\Ngot quite a case of bedhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.22,0:24:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, how embarrassing. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll ask them\Nto leave. Uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.80,0:24:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.72,0:24:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Iceberg. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.16,0:24:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.80,0:24:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two need to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Government officials are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hello again, Corgi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.88,0:24:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm not here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are. Come now.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:38.37,0:24:45.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(645,438)\fs48\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Corgy{\fs37}\NWorld Government Official
Dialogue: 2,0:24:38.37,0:24:45.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(645,438)\fs48\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Corgy{\fs37}\NWorld Government Official
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come all the way\Nout here by Sea Train.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't turn me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.00,0:24:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impolite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.52,0:24:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I detect\Nthe scent of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, I want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like you. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a child? Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm totally an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.78,0:25:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, then start acting like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.78,0:25:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something of special\Nimportance I need to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.92,0:25:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it\Nif you'd hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.56,0:25:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, let's talk this over in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.80,0:25:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those government guys\Nare so damn persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.54,0:25:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do they\Nwant with Iceberg anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it has nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably political stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I beat them up? I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.76,0:25:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, they're government guys after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.56,0:25:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something seemed weird about\Nthese bags when I grabbed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really light.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.72,0:25:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.63,0:25:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.94,0:25:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, stop kidding around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.58,0:25:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they be with\Nall of that money inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.72,0:26:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.08,0:26:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots, what the hell are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.26,0:26:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady, if you sit like\Nthat, everyone can see your...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.08,0:26:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.18,0:26:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.06,0:26:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,200 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.54,0:26:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.18,0:26:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, look at these bags,\Nthey're not even ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, keep it down! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.66,0:26:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our money, our money's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.78,0:26:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finished, gone, disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.31,0:26:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polly, was it you again? Huh? No! Honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.38,0:26:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I lie? You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.82,0:26:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.26,0:26:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaku, question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were you hanging out with\Nthe Franky family earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.62,0:26:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.18,0:27:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been anywhere near a single\Nmember of the Franky family all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.92,0:27:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.62,0:27:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so certain that I saw your\Nlong nose. Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.22,0:27:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw him with the Franky family?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you could say he was with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.42,0:27:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or maybe you could say he\Nwas being dragged away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's called kidnapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.84,0:27:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we gotta find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.62,0:27:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.94,0:27:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.54,0:27:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Money!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.96,0:27:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the Franky Family's hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.12,0:27:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not really a hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.82,0:27:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like a workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.56,0:27:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From where your ship is docked, it's\Nway up the seashore to the northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's off by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.70,0:27:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called the Franky House.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.80,0:27:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.32,0:28:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could find Usopp\Nin this place all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.60,0:28:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.26,0:28:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't keep looking for him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.76,0:28:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I do anything else I need to\Ntake this money back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.90,0:28:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I march in there demanding our 200\Nmillion back while holding 100 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.76,0:28:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be asking them to\Nsteal that money too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.44,0:28:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yagra, please take me to the bull shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shortest route possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.54,0:28:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take Zoro and the others\Nwith me and teach them a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.14,0:28:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stealing from pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.64,0:28:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky family, that makes\Nyou the lowest of the low!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First floor, Backstreet Shopping District.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.54,0:28:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, and have a wonderful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.44,0:28:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's her problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.16,0:28:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.08,0:28:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Usopp was able to\Nescape from them, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.90,0:29:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.14,0:29:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's this guy from?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey does anybody know him? Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.90,0:29:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.36,0:29:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, gotta wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.52,0:29:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.43,0:29:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.08,0:29:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.90,0:29:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.12,0:29:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes! Usopp! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.90,0:29:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but are you two\Npirates by any chance? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.60,0:29:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop scaring and mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.02,0:29:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.26,0:29:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.66,0:29:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it the Franky family?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.66,0:30:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened because I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.34,0:30:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.94,0:30:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.28,0:30:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I face the others now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.88,0:30:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were finally able to fix the fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.56,0:30:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.50,0:30:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.02,0:30:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.16,0:30:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been beaten pretty badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.74,0:30:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't move him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.12,0:30:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, stay right here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.56,0:30:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go back to the ship\Nto get the others to come and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper will have you fixed\Nup good as new in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.72,0:31:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And listen, don't worry about\Nthe stolen money, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.44,0:31:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I've heard, their hideout\Nisn't too far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll crush them and that'll\Nbe the end of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.58,0:31:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you think this is some kind of show?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.64,0:31:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay put, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.96,0:31:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.88,0:31:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Yagoras! Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.98,0:31:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A runaway bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.62,0:31:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were finally able to fix the Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.76,0:31:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you pay, that ship\Ncan't be restored to how she used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.84,0:31:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether we decide to give\Nin and buy a new ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.46,0:31:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or we have someone else manage\Nto fix and improve the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.48,0:32:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't put the entire\N300 million into this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.80,0:32:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our future journeys together\Nwill be difficult for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.10,0:32:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need that money. All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.80,0:32:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.90,0:32:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.48,0:32:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what the shipwright said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.08,0:32:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship can't be fixed,\Neven if we have money!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.20,0:32:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, then what's going to\Nhappen to the Mary? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.44,0:32:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.42,0:32:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it really just depends\Non how Luffy and the
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.50,0:32:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,others react after hearing the assessment?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm sure they'll get it\Nsorted out while they're at the shipyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.48,0:32:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just seems so extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.34,0:32:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same old Mary that she's always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.98,0:32:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've traveled together on this ship all\Nthe way from the East Blue to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.28,0:32:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.70,0:32:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just answered your own question.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.20,0:32:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human beings become stronger,\Nhardship after hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.82,0:32:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ships are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.62,0:32:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their wounds just pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.70,0:33:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hard to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.38,0:33:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what is Usopp going to say\Nwhen he hears about all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.00,0:33:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.68,0:33:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.72,0:33:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, we all do, but\Nher wounds are too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.02,0:33:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.56,0:33:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary's in trouble and\NRobin's still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.16,0:33:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.98,0:33:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.92,0:33:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Nami and she's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.32,0:33:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.64,0:33:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to Luffy and Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.48,0:33:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.98,0:33:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everything alright?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1114,444)\fs41\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Water Seven\NOutskirts\NNortheast Coast
Dialogue: 2,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1114,444)\fs41\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Water Seven\NOutskirts\NNortheast Coast
Dialogue: 1,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(142,386)\fs41\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Dismantlers
Dialogue: 2,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(142,386)\fs41\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Dismantlers
Dialogue: 1,0:33:45.83,0:33:51.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1134,382)\fs41\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}The Franky House
Dialogue: 2,0:33:45.83,0:33:51.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1134,382)\fs41\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}The Franky House
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.88,0:33:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.24,0:33:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,200 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.80,0:33:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, 200 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.88,0:33:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.22,0:33:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.94,0:33:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.96,0:33:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:34:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we have this much money, we'll\Nbe able to get what we've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We actually did it, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.38,0:34:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After three years, our\Nperseverance has finally paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.02,0:34:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stoked! Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.20,0:34:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time we'd have a little money,\Nwe'd bet it all on the Yagato races!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.46,0:34:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lose every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each time we'd collect a criminal's\Nbounty, we'd party and drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.78,0:34:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And spend it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.44,0:34:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could never ever save up the 200\Nmillion berries that we needed, until now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.06,0:34:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally have enough to get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then some!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.78,0:34:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys did a hell of a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I know it isn't much,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.68,0:34:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but here's five million berries\Nto show you how grateful I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat, drink, and have a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.26,0:34:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.30,0:35:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What fool would dare to\Noppose the Franky family?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.69,0:35:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that weak thing we ran into earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.72,0:35:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you even manage to stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.34,0:35:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us our money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.22,0:35:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us our money back, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.72,0:35:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're\None of the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.44,0:35:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.40,0:35:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He totally is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was expecting all of the Straw\NHat crew to be really strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.48,0:35:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this one's not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a complete\Nweakling. What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your own damn business!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.52,0:35:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.92,0:35:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some guts trying to take\Nback the money all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.86,0:35:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I can't let you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.08,0:36:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.34,0:36:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need the money
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.54,0:36:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to fix the berry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.30,0:36:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her scars are deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.20,0:36:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.16,0:36:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's to heal her wounds, understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.02,0:36:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.12,0:36:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.38,0:36:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you so worked up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.22,0:36:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like you love your ship quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.52,0:36:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter whatever condition she's\Nin, this money belongs to us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.86,0:36:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.70,0:37:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, in this world, stealing\Nfrom pirates isn't really seen as a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.62,0:37:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is probably dirty money\Nyou swiped somewhere along the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.16,0:37:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let us have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.12,0:37:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could beg the Navy for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.00,0:37:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, they'd just arrest ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.88,0:37:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got himself a useless\Ncrony who can't even
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.22,0:37:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handle the simple task of\Nguarding a little money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.96,0:37:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a shame. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.00,0:37:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.88,0:37:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them all the hospitality of\Nthe Franky House while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.38,0:37:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No time like the present to start\Nshopping with this pile of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.76,0:37:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this is gonna be great.\NHold it! Sensual attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.72,0:37:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding star!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.48,0:38:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember my name long-nosed\Nboy it's Franky if you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.22,0:38:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to leave this city alive\NI'd suggest you never cross
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.86,0:38:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.76,0:38:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you call this
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.38,0:38:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little kid soy
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.29,0:38:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a weapon see you later long
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.12,0:38:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nose thanks again for the 200
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.54,0:38:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Wait! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.22,0:38:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give back the berry! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.80,0:38:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.24,0:39:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.26,0:39:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to wait here\Nuntil Robin comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.14,0:39:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I march in with the others\Nright now, I'll just be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.86,0:39:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be scary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.28,0:39:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.38,0:39:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the best thing I can do is stay here,\Nguard the money, and protect the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.34,0:39:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.30,0:39:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.10,0:39:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.56,0:39:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.56,0:39:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place Nami was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.78,0:40:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, this is the Backstreet\NShopping District.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.78,0:40:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go up this canal, turn, then here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.30,0:40:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp is right here. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.02,0:40:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, where are those\Ndismantlers you mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.50,0:40:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Franky family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.58,0:40:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.04,0:40:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you just screwed up the direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.84,0:40:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not you, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.14,0:40:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your hole! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.68,0:40:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.82,0:40:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.34,0:40:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blood, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.38,0:40:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.74,0:40:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he walked off\Nsomewhere on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.24,0:40:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't think that he...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.42,0:40:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.96,0:40:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.46,0:40:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.58,0:40:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Luffy! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.16,0:40:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.58,0:41:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.26,0:41:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where the hell did you fall from?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.44,0:41:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to jump around like\Nthat carpenter to look for Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.84,0:41:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.86,0:41:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.77,0:41:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a terrible problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.08,0:41:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp was abducted, and so was the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.14,0:41:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.05,0:41:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.12,0:41:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.03,0:41:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just about to head over to\Nthe hideout of the guys that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.82,0:41:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet that's where we'll\Nfind Usopp and the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.62,0:41:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he felt responsible\Nabout what happened and went
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.38,0:41:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to settle the matter with\Nthe Franky family on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.50,0:42:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is he breathing chopper he's
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.28,0:42:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unconscious but yes he's breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.32,0:42:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.23,0:42:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.42,0:42:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wait out here for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.94,0:42:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go level that\Nstupid house to the ground.
